Main basic idea behind the question :Counting recurrence of some set of letters in given string
///
Question Problem: 1)Take a string and substring as input from user 
2)Count the number of times same order of characters given in substring are written in main string
///
How I solved the question : 1) Due to last question I attempted , I thought of tackling this question using lists(even though i knew this was a "for"type question)
2) But that would have seperate strings into different items and then finding a group of string from them did not seem possible
3) I mapped the question and saw that splicing would be appropiate to check for same sub strings and thus came finally came up with this code after a lot of trial and testing:
count=0
    for i in range(len(string) - len(sub_string) + 1):
         if string[i:i + len(sub_string)] == sub_string:
             count += 1
    return count
